# Default environment for `pnpm dev`, loaded by tsx via `--env-file`.
# Committed on purpose: these are non-secret local-development defaults only.
#
# Why a file instead of an inline `DATABASE_URL=... ` in package.json: the inline
# form is shell syntax that breaks on Windows (cmd.exe), where `pnpm dev` would
# fail. An env file works identically on every OS. A real environment variable
# still wins over this file (Node/tsx never override an already-set variable), and
# a personal `.env` (gitignored) can override these values too.
#
# `pnpm dev` starts PostgreSQL via Docker Compose on this host/port (see compose.yaml).
DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres@localhost:5432/uxtweet
